POST CLUB 1985-03-12 17:05 LEADER
SUBJECT THE CLUB IS ON THE LINE
THE CLUB NOW HAS ITS OWN NUMBER. YOU CAN FETCH OUR GAMES FROM HOME, IF YOUR PARENTS AGREE TO THE TELEPHONE BILL.
ON TUESDAYS WE WRITE GAMES, ON FRIDAYS WE PLAY THEM.
.

