POST FIRST 1985-10-02 16:10 KOSTYA
SUBJECT HOW TO START A GAME
I DOWNLOADED TROIKA.TRI. NOW WHAT?
.

POST FIRST 1985-10-02 17:45 LEADER
SUBJECT RE: HOW TO START A GAME
HANG UP (ESC, THEN H), THEN TYPE BRUN "TROIKA". A .TB FILE IS A TRIBASIC PROGRAM: LOAD "NAME", THEN RUN.
.

FILE GAMES TRIZMEYK.TRI 1985-03-12 LEADER
TRIZMEYKA: THE SNAKE THAT EATS TRITS. JOYSTICK, SOUND, HIGH SCORE.
.

FILE GAMES TROIKA.TRI 1985-04-02 LEADER
TROIKA: A PUZZLE OF -, 0 AND +. MAKE EVERY CELL 0.
.

FILE GAMES OBLAKA.TRI 1985-09-10 LENA
OBLAKA: FLY ABOVE THE CLOUDS. MANY SPRITES, SCROLLING.
.

FILE GAMES PIANO.TRI 1985-05-05 LEADER
A PIANO ON THE KEYBOARD. THE JOYSTICK CHANGES THE SOUND.
.

FILE GAMES ZMEYKA.TB 1985-06-20 SASHA
A SMALL SNAKE IN TRIBASIC, TO READ AND CHANGE.
.

FILE GAMES GUESS.TB 1985-06-21 VOVA
GUESS THE NUMBER. THE HINTS SAY <, = OR >. TRIBASIC.
